Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.90,0:00:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:05.40,0:00:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:07.70,0:00:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:10.30,0:00:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.80,0:00:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:17.50,0:00:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.80,0:00:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:29.00,0:00:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:34.20,0:00:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下　{\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.90,0:00:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が　{\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:45.30,0:00:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.50,0:00:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.80,0:01:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:05.30,0:01:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.30,0:01:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:11.10,0:01:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:16.20,0:01:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.70,0:01:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.60,0:01:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:27.20,0:01:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.60,0:01:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.90,0:01:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.40,0:01:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.20,0:01:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:18.10,0:02:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的消失了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:22.10,0:02:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 就說幾句話也行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:24.80,0:02:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經說了 我女兒不想見你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:28.30,0:02:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請通融一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:30.00,0:02:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,適可而止吧 不然就叫警察了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:43.90,0:02:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 我是柴田
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:45.30,0:02:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底要我等到什麼時候啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:47.80,0:02:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照片怎麼樣了啊 照片
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.60,0:02:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照片
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:51.70,0:02:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柴田 你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:53.30,0:02:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 好的 這禮拜一定…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.30,0:03:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 忘得一乾二淨了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.70,0:03:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這些是弘美小姐做的麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:19.20,0:03:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 這是我們店的主打產品 姐姐的得意之作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:25.30,0:03:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請嚐嚐看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:37.80,0:03:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:39.30,0:03:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這種觸感是 腐竹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:42.90,0:03:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好喫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:43.90,0:03:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:46.30,0:03:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是弘美小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:48.40,0:03:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個味兒可挺不好做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.00,0:03:53.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 真是可惜這樣的人才了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:54.20,0:03:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老實說 還是希望你們能留在我們這一起做呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:59.30,0:04:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常感謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:01.60,0:04:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過 開店一直是姐姐和我的夢想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:05.90,0:04:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且也是令尊的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:08.40,0:04:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:10.90,0:04:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以的話 也請品嚐一下這些
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:14.80,0:04:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過這個奶酪和豆腐的也很好喫哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:19.80,0:04:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}甜蜜的陷阱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:27.83,0:04:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs22\pos(400,120)\c&H51B748&\frz1}糕點坊『夢想』
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:27.83,0:04:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs20\pos(410,430)\c&H797979&\frz1}原創糕點品種齊全\N恭候各位光臨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:40.60,0:04:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄好了 弄好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.60,0:04:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.10,0:04:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 原來爸爸想象的廚房是這樣的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.70,0:04:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝你 由香
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:51.20,0:04:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:52.20,0:04:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能這麼快就把店開出來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.50,0:04:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是託了每天打工一起攢錢的由香的福
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:59.30,0:05:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 那是我該做的嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:01.30,0:05:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲這是我們兩個決定的嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.40,0:05:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是這樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.50,0:05:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是爸爸也能在這裏做蛋糕就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.40,0:05:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.60,0:05:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過更重要的是今後的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.30,0:05:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必須好好賺錢還債纔行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:44.70,0:05:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.00,0:05:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼說來 有個好消息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:49.00,0:05:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好消息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:54.10,0:05:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 森崎先生那裏嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.30,0:05:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 他答應要是把姐姐的蛋糕帶去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:00.00,0:06:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就幫忙在街角蛋糕節目中宣傳咱們的店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:04.70,0:06:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個節目很受歡迎的 正好能做宣傳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.50,0:06:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 拍攝是在下週六
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.30,0:06:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等…等等 由香
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:15.80,0:06:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天可是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.30,0:06:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他說要宣傳當然是開張那天最好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:20.20,0:06:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是個好人啊 森崎先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.50,0:06:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 當天把“遺產”拿出來不是很好嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.50,0:06:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs18}Héritage    法語【遺產】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:30.00,0:06:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她對姐姐的事讚不絕口呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:39.50,0:06:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鄰居們也深受其害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:42.70,0:06:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,區政府也意識到要儘快處理
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:46.40,0:06:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是現在還沒有有效的解決方法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:49.90,0:06:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,實在不是什麼好照片啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.60,0:06:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又要被總編罵了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.70,0:06:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下來是街角蛋糕節目
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.50,0:07:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 好像很好喫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:05.60,0:07:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天首先由請森崎先生來介紹他的新作蛋糕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.70,0:07:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是這個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:13.10,0:07:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個蛋糕叫什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.40,0:07:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它的名字是“微醉”
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.40,0:07:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs18}Ivresse      法語【微醉】
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:17.60,0:07:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,裏面用了神祕的材料
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.60,0:07:25.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能順利進行嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.90,0:07:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒問題
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.00,0:07:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交給我就好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.60,0:07:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hi 拍攝前一分鐘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:32.10,0:07:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼就照例叫出伊藤吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:35.70,0:07:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊藤小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.90,0:07:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 最喜歡甜食的記者伊藤
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:41.40,0:07:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我們採訪的是本日開張的糕點坊『夢想』
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.00,0:07:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這位女糕點師是春日弘美小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.60,0:07:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有她的妹妹由香小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:51.50,0:07:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 請她們馬上介紹一下點心吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:55.00,0:07:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:55.80,0:07:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是我店的主打蛋糕“遺產”
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:05.90,0:08:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個蛋糕是姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:09.30,0:08:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是本店的糕點師構思已久的蛋糕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:13.30,0:08:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個跟剛纔的蛋糕一樣哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:15.40,0:08:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs20}在原料中加入了切碎的腐竹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:16.00,0:08:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這可不妙啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:18.50,0:08:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個不是和森崎老師的一樣嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.40,0:08:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼搞的 給我聯繫現場監督
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:24.20,0:08:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起來是西式點心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:25.90,0:08:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是喫起來就會有一種很親切的感覺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:28.00,0:08:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放廣告
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:30.70,0:08:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改成廣告了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:33.50,0:08:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟透啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:37.00,0:08:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,截稿了 截稿了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:40.40,0:08:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和森崎先生的蛋糕一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:43.40,0:08:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這到底是什麼意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:46.20,0:08:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以說我們沒事先好好調查也有責任
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:50.30,0:08:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是沒想到會出來完全一樣的東西啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:54.30,0:08:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要模仿也無所謂啊 怎麼偏偏…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:56.70,0:08:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纔沒模仿
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:58.20,0:08:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由香
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:59.00,0:09:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:01.60,0:09:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這太奇怪了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:03.30,0:09:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是我們…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:05.90,0:09:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:07.10,0:09:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.80,0:09:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:19.90,0:09:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,勞駕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.10,0:09:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十分抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.60,0:09:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收您兩千圓 請稍等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.20,0:09:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂 你知道地獄通信嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:30.50,0:09:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道知道 午夜零點登錄的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.80,0:09:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就可以幫你消除怨恨的那個吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:36.40,0:09:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對對
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:42.00,0:09:45.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打工到太晚了 不快回去幫忙就…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:49.20,0:09:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個店吧 最近剽竊森崎的蛋糕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:53.80,0:09:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說是原來的徒弟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:56.30,0:09:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快會倒閉的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 估計是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:05.00,0:10:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:06.20,0:10:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎回來 怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.80,0:10:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,客人呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:12.70,0:10:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天才有兩個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.10,0:10:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 我還是想去找他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.10,0:10:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這也太過分了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:23.90,0:10:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這可不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:25.20,0:10:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:27.20,0:10:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在去了也沒用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:29.20,0:10:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以說還是別去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:30.30,0:10:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是這樣下去…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:50.40,0:10:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.50,0:10:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然只是個傳言吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:57.90,0:10:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說起來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.70,0:11:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是這個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:36.50,0:11:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:39.40,0:11:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:42.60,0:11:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:45.10,0:11:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在就去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:00.90,0:12:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已予受理
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.80,0:12:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:10.00,0:12:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.10,0:12:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呼喚我的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:15.90,0:12:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:17.90,0:12:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:19.20,0:12:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:24.00,0:12:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:37.00,0:12:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:40.50,0:12:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被騙了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:45.50,0:12:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,開店是死去的父親 姐姐和我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.70,0:12:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全家的夢想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:51.90,0:12:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個夢想卻被摧毀了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:54.30,0:12:56.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 請幫我消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:57.60,0:12:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恨那個男人嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:59.80,0:13:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恨不得殺死他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.60,0:13:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那 那個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:04.20,0:13:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,輪入道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:05.80,0:13:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:15.00,0:13:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:16.80,0:13:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:18.30,0:13:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:23.40,0:13:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將這紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:26.10,0:13:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:27.70,0:13:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我正式締結了契約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:31.90,0:13:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:37.90,0:13:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.20,0:13:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身也將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:45.50,0:13:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.90,0:13:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:51.00,0:13:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,締結契約後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.90,0:13:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的靈魂亦將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:57.90,0:13:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無法前往極樂淨土
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:00.20,0:14:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將飽嘗痛楚與苦難
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:02.80,0:14:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永遠彷徨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過那是你死之後的事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:15.30,0:14:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:18.00,0:14:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之後的事 就由你自己抉擇了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:30.00,0:14:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:43.20,0:14:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,貸款到期了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:45.40,0:14:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也試着跟上面商量了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:48.80,0:14:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 至少要是能還清利息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:52.50,0:14:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逾期的部分我們一定還清
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:55.20,0:14:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 請您再寬容一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:58.90,0:15:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真可惜 我實在無能爲力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.50,0:15:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請您幫幫忙吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:07.20,0:15:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 辛苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:11.40,0:15:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣可以了吧 森崎先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:15.70,0:15:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,足夠了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:17.70,0:15:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,給您添麻煩了 分店長
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:32.60,0:15:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,店鋪出租
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:42.40,0:15:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由香 我們走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:45.70,0:15:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由香
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:48.00,0:15:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:49.80,0:15:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要是不去找那傢伙的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:52.60,0:15:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不會這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:54.80,0:15:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是由香的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:56.80,0:15:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼我們會遇到這種事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:59.50,0:16:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們又沒做錯什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:02.80,0:16:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:05.90,0:16:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些話和你說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:09.10,0:16:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:19.30,0:16:22.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糕點品嚐會    嘉賓 森崎伸也    贊助 目高電視
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:29.00,0:16:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,貴店的事我聽說了 很可惜啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:32.80,0:16:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就是你搞垮的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.80,0:16:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且還是爲了報復被姐姐甩掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:38.80,0:16:40.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厚顏無恥地親近姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:41.00,0:16:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被拒絕了就做出這種事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:44.30,0:16:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太差勁了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:45.80,0:16:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被甩是當然的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:48.20,0:16:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說什麼都隨便你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:50.00,0:16:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在店也回不來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.00,0:16:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我很感謝你呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:55.60,0:16:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲你給了我絕好的復仇機會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:00.40,0:17:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過沒想到會那麼順利
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:03.70,0:17:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久沒這麼痛快了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.70,0:17:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就拼命工作還債吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:11.70,0:17:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不然我介紹你去個好地方怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:15.00,0:17:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們兩個都是相當漂亮的美人呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:20.40,0:17:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好加油吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:28.70,0:17:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:30.90,0:17:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,絕對不能原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:46.10,0:17:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:58.40,0:18:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛 長衫放好了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:02.40,0:18:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝 婆婆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:38.40,0:18:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 各位客人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:39.50,0:18:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請品嚐森崎先生的新品蛋糕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:43.00,0:18:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好喫啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:44.40,0:18:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是森崎先生的蛋糕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:49.80,0:18:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼蛋糕啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:51.60,0:18:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼難喫也能喫嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:53.80,0:18:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當我們是白癡嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:55.40,0:18:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓我們喫這種垃圾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:58.20,0:19:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹什麼 住手 住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:07.10,0:19:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,森崎伸也
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:08.70,0:19:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對 那時電視上的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:11.50,0:19:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和一個女孩在一起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:13.40,0:19:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼 是做同一個蛋糕的女孩嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:22.60,0:19:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請等等 不是我 這蛋糕不是我做的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:29.80,0:19:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼說你的蛋糕是剽竊別人是真的咯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:33.90,0:19:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且是爲了報復被女人甩掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:36.20,0:19:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是獨家新聞啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:37.80,0:19:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是啊 森崎先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:46.00,0:19:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼搞的 到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:52.40,0:19:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弘美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:53.40,0:19:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,森崎先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:54.50,0:19:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實我也對您
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:58.90,0:19:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弘美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:01.00,0:20:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 嚐嚐我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:04.60,0:20:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嚐嚐我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:12.70,0:20:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪都行 快開車
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:14.60,0:20:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:17.70,0:20:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:19.40,0:20:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是在做夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:22.00,0:20:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,客人 您喜歡喫甜食吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:29.20,0:20:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:34.70,0:20:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍微嚐到點教訓了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:40.00,0:20:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她們兩人好不容易開的店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:42.60,0:20:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也太過分了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.20,0:20:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對自己的所作所爲道歉吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:46.90,0:20:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道歉 爲什麼我要道歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:50.90,0:20:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是認真地喜歡她的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:54.80,0:20:56.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直這麼多關照她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:56.80,0:20:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她辜負了我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:58.30,0:20:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:00.50,0:21:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他這麼說呢 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:05.90,0:21:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗中的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:08.80,0:21:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷害鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:11.00,0:21:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:18.70,0:21:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:34.30,0:21:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是那裏 要去哪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:38.00,0:21:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:40.00,0:21:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的蛋糕再也不會給你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:46.20,0:21:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:48.60,0:21:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:08.20,0:22:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,森崎先生呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:09.30,0:22:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪都找不到啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:10.90,0:22:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能不見了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:12.30,0:22:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快給我去找
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:14.60,0:22:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚了一步啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:21.50,0:22:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多謝惠顧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:25.70,0:22:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:26.70,0:22:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 來晚了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:29.70,0:22:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,給 便當
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:30.80,0:22:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:32.20,0:22:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我去打工了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:34.70,0:22:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:35.70,0:22:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:38.20,0:22:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:42.50,0:22:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 我還沒有放棄哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:46.30,0:22:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,絕對要再開一次店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:57.00,0:23:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.40,0:23:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て　{\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:21.90,0:23:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て　{\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
