Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.45,0:24:32.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:33.50,0:24:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:35.20,0:24:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澀谷南
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:37.30,0:24:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的好嗎 是朋友吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:41.40,0:24:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原來的確是朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:43.20,0:24:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且還是我唯一的好朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:46.00,0:24:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可她卻做出那種事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:48.70,0:24:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:50.20,0:24:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,願望是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:52.20,0:24:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將那傢伙流放到地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:54.80,0:24:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:58.00,0:25:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&H0000FF&}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:58.00,0:25:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}朋友
